cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Finite-time residuals in discrete Ollivier-Ricci flow: reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Code and raw results accompanying the study of finite-time residuals in
  discrete Ollivier-Ricci flow: a measurement framework separating the
  finite-horizon residual, its numerical counterpart, the dynamical trend and
  the geometric infimum, with controls for the stopping rule, the estimator,
  the transport solver and the network topology.
